    "fields": {
      "sample": "first and last month-end price used, and the horizons in months",
      "exhibit10_cost_of_capital": "by fund: the index it tracks, its own first and last month, `months`, and `cost_of_capital_pct`, its geometric mean annual return over that sample, in per cent",
      "exhibit11_realized_gain": "by horizon (6m, 12m, 24m, 36m), then by fund: `observations`, the number of start months; `first_start_month`, `last_start_month`; `mean`, `std`, `min`, `max` of the realized gain, as fractions, with the start months of the minimum and maximum; `share_abs_above_20pp`, the share of start months with a gain above 0.20 in absolute value; `share_positive`, overall and for start months in 2000 to 2002 and in 2010 to 2018; `autocorrelation_lag1`; `sign_changes`, the number of times the gain changes sign from one start month to the next. Each horizon also has `dispersion`, the standard deviation of QQQ and of IWM over that of SPY",
      "proposition6_proportionality": "`observations`, the number of fund, horizon and start-month cases checked; `max_abs_deviation_below_1e-12`, true if implied gain equals realized gain divided by the compounded cost of capital in every case; `implied_over_realized`, that ratio by fund and horizon"
    }
